{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_090C40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"The Boss的飞船偏离轨道，远远错过预定溅落点，在减速不足的情况下直接撞上了海面。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"飞船在入水冲击下严重损毁，随即沉没。The Boss总算靠自己的力量逃到了水面……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"她全身挫伤，还遭受了辐射。能活下来简直不可思议。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"之后，她就这样持续昏迷了整整半年。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"遗憾的是，加加林进入太空的时间还是比她稍早一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"即便如此，美国首次载人航天飞行本应是一项辉煌的成就。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可是，这件事并没有被写进历史。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这是为了保住美国的面子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"加加林进入环绕轨道并绕地球一周，而美国这边只是弹道飞行，飞行时间也相差甚远。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"更重要的是，苏联的飞船和飞行员都平安无事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"偏偏The Boss又活着回来了，连把这件事包装成一段壮烈美谈都做不到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"真正一锤定音的，是苏联在飞行结束后立刻展开的宣传攻势。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"“地球是蓝色的”……以这句话为代表，加加林讲述的太空体验迅速传遍全世界。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"转眼间，加加林便收获了全世界的赞美与祝福。对苏联来说，这是再好不过的宣传。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"美国政府只能保持沉默。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"他们判断，公开The Boss的飞行不仅起不到宣传作用，反而会产生负面效果。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"于是政府把她的飞行当作一项见不得光的任务，彻底埋葬了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"NASA和CIA竭尽全力，从Mercury计划中抹去The Boss留下的一切痕迹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"结果就是这张照片。修得真漂亮，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不只是飞行计划，就连她这个人的存在本身，也被当成了“从未存在”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"而且，还不止如此。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"为了制造不在场证明，军方对外宣称The Boss参加了CIA夺回古巴的“猪湾事件”行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"而且在她康复之后，军方也没有重新接纳The Boss。她只能转入地下。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"对外，The Boss仍然是“大战英雄”。可实际上却完全不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"她已经成了官方意义上不存在的人，只能接下<R=脏活,BLACK OPS>……没错，她被当成了亡者。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=脏活,BLACK OPS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"加加林周游世界，接受人们的祝福。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"而The Boss却成了“活着的亡者”，甚至连自己的经历都不被允许说出口。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"据说，政府高官曾这样对她说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"“你为什么还在这里？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"“如果当时你也像加加林那样留下一句像样的名言，然后光荣地死去，本来还能作为英雄留下名字。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"三周后的5月5日，“Original 7”之一Alan Shepard成功完成了太空弹道飞行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"他的成功被媒体大肆报道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"那正是以The Boss的失败为基础加以改进后取得的成果。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"据说苏联在加加林飞行之前，曾用<R=　人　形　,IVAN IVANOVICH>进行着陆实验。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=　人　形　,IVAN IVANOVICH>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"这样一来，The Boss受到的待遇就和假人没什么两样……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"可她却说：“不管是假人还是什么，只要我的飞行能帮助计划取得成功，我就心满意足了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"但是，事情还没有结束。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"The Boss借助苏联国内反政府“贤者们”的关系网，安插了<R=潜伏特工,SLEEPER>，借此接近苏联的太空开发计划。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=潜伏特工,SLEEPER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":143,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"可从某个时候开始，这件事对苏联方面就已经完全暴露了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"尽管如此，美国方面却始终没能掌握这个事实……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"就连The Boss联络上的“贤者们”网络，也没有传来潜伏特工已经背叛的消息。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"这里只有两种可能。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"要么是亲近苏联政府的“贤者们”出手干预，要么是原本反政府的“贤者们”被收买了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"对美国一方的“贤者们”而言，这是绝对无法容忍的事实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"仅仅为了保住“贤者们”的面子，也可以说只是为了做个了断，The Boss便不得不再次潜入苏联。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":125,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"在那里，她与苏联一方的特工正面对峙……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}